37,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, that explains the layout issues. But the money is shocking. We pay thirty-four thousand yen yearly just for open bags.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@May, those eleven complaints show how much pain is hidden. @Mizuki, a ninety-centimetre frontage is too tight for a permanent structure.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
