44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, the next lane’s supervised mornings average fifty minutes. With a rotation, each house handles about twenty a year. That is a manageable, shared rhythm.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
